Flowcraft for Codex

Independent Codex-native workflow inspired by PaperBanana / PaperVizAgent.
Upstream source files inspected carry Copyright 2026 Google LLC and the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream license is retained in LICENSE.

This package rewrites the workflow and supplies original local rendering,
validation, export, installation and test helpers. It does not contain
upstream model inference code, model weights or benchmark figures.

Additional public works informing design choices are attributed in
docs/comparison.md. No implementation code from those projects is included.
